    <p class="!mt-0 font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-agent-300 uppercase">Important notice before you use DroidHands</p>
    <p class="!mt-2.5 text-sm">
      DroidHands connects <strong>your</strong> third-party AI agents to <strong>your</strong> phone. AI agents can make mistakes, hallucinate, misclick, retry actions, or be tricked by prompt injection in incoming messages or web pages. <strong>You alone choose what access to grant, and you are 100% responsible for every action an agent takes on your phone</strong> — including messages sent, calls placed, data disclosed, purchases made, or third-party account bans. DroidHands is free, open-source software provided <strong>“as is” without warranties or liability</strong>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section id="acceptance">
    <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms &amp; eligibility</h2>
    <p>
      These Terms of Service (“<strong>Terms</strong>”) govern your access to and use of the DroidHands mobile applications for Android and iOS (the “<strong>Apps</strong>”), the optional default hosted relay at <code>connect.droidhands.com</code> (the “<strong>Default Relay</strong>”), and the website at <code>droidhands.com</code> (the “<strong>Website</strong>,” and together with the Apps and Default Relay, the “<strong>Service</strong>”), provided by the DroidHands project and its maintainers (“<strong>DroidHands</strong>,” “<strong>we</strong>,” “<strong>us</strong>,” or “<strong>our</strong>”).
    </p>
    <p>
