      <li>Access, exfiltrate, or tamper with accounts, financial systems, or data without authorization;</li>
      <li>Abuse, overload, scrape, DDoS, bypass rate limits on, or intentionally exhaust the free-tier quotas of <code>connect.droidhands.com</code>, or attempt to probe or interfere with other users' connections; or</li>
      <li>Violate export control, sanctions, or other applicable laws.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>No high-risk, financial, or emergency use</h3>
