      <li><strong>Not end-to-end encrypted:</strong> As explained in our <a href={PRIVACY_URL}>Privacy Policy</a> and <a href={SECURITY_URL}>Security Model</a>, TLS terminates at the relay. Do not route traffic through the Default Relay if you are unwilling to accept that architecture — self-host your own relay or use USB/Tailscale instead.</li>
